# Périodes : une seule période active par compte (index unique periods_one_active_per_account) -> 409.
# Lancement : npx httpyac send --all http/periode-active-unique.http --var port=8080 --var anon=<ANON_KEY de `supabase status`>
# (la clé vient de la ligne de commande, jamais du fichier ; l'utilisateur est jetable, créé par le fichier)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:{{port}}
@authUrl = http://127.0.0.1:54321/auth/v1

### Utilisateur jetable
# @name login
POST {{authUrl}}/signup
apikey: {{anon}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "periode-active-{{$timestamp}}@example.com", "password": "Password123!" }

?? status == 200

### Compte jetable
# @name account
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "periode-active-{{$timestamp}}", "initialBalance": "0" }

?? status == 201

### P1 (octobre) : créée, active
# @name p1
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startDate": "2026-10-01", "endDate": "2026-10-31", "budgets": [] }

?? status == 201

### P2 (novembre) : créée, active ; P1 passe inactive
# @name p2
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "startDate": "2026-11-01", "endDate": "2026-11-30", "budgets": [] }

?? status == 201

### Réactiver P1 alors que P2 est active : refusé
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{p1.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isActive": true }

?? status == 409
?? body contains Another period is already active for this account

### Clôturer P2
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{p2.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isActive": false }

?? status == 200

### Réactiver P1 : accepté
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods/{{p1.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "isActive": true }

?? status == 200

### Une seule période active
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{account.id}}/periods
Authorization: Bearer {{login.access_token}}

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.length == 2
?? js response.parsedBody.filter(p => p.isActive).length == 1
